From: =?UTF-8?q?Vivek=20Das=C2=A0Mohapatra?= <vivek@collabora.co.uk>
Date: Sun, 28 Apr 2024 13:30:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] gitlab-ci: Move CI builds to isolated / heavy runner(s)

Moves CI onto the new "heavy" runner, which should speed things up.

(cherry picked from commit 23bf76c0bcd344204e96995945144a83932c763c)
Signed-off-by: Cristian Ciocaltea <cristian.ciocaltea@collabora.com>
Signed-off-by: Henry Paradiz <henry.paradiz@gmail.com>
---
 .gitlab-ci.yml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.gitlab-ci.yml b/.gitlab-ci.yml
index 067d3cfc314f..903b66cfa7d9 100644
--- a/.gitlab-ci.yml
+++ b/.gitlab-ci.yml
@@ -13,6 +13,8 @@ default:
   interruptible: true
   tags:
     - autoscaled
+    - isolated
+    - linux-heavy
 
 workflow:
   rules:
-- 
2.55.0

